 "panels": [
  {
   "x": 45,
   "y": 854,
   "w": 497,
   "title": "Tendinitis or tendinosis? It changes the treatment",
   "items": [
    "TENDINITIS (less common): true inflammation from rheumatologic disease, acute overload or infection → rest, ice, compression, elevation (RICE), anti-inflammatories, treat the cause · recovers faster",
    "TENDINOSIS (more common): collagen degeneration from chronic overuse, NO inflammation → therapies that rebuild collagen, analgesics · slow: 100+ days to make collagen"
   ],
   "cols": 1
  },
  {
   "x": 556,
   "y": 854,
   "w": 497,
   "title": "Tendinosis care, in order",
   "items": [
    "1 · Educate: what it is, what to expect, change the offending activity",
    "2 · Relative rest (by time or task) · ergonomics · ice · orthoses or taping",
    "3 · Physiotherapy: ECCENTRIC strengthening twice daily × 12 weeks · massage",
    "4 · Anti-inflammatories (topical preferred) help less in tendinOSIS",
    "5 · Platelet-rich plasma (PRP)? · surgical referral if refractory"
   ],
   "cols": 1
  }
 ]
}